  "body": "Write a program to obtain a number $(N)$ from the user and display whether the number is a one digit number, 2 digit number, 3 digit number or more than 3 digit number\r\n\r\n###Input:\r\n\r\n- First line will contain the number $N$,\r\n\r\n###Output:\r\nPrint \"1\" if N is a 1 digit number.\r\n\r\nPrint \"2\" if N is a 2 digit number.\r\n\r\nPrint \"3\" if N is a 3 digit number.\r\n\r\nPrint \"More than 3 digits\" if N has more than 3 digits.\r\n\r\n###Constraints \r\n- $0 \\leq N \\leq 1000000$\r\n\r\n###Sample Input:\r\n\t9\r\n\r\n###Sample Output:\r\n\t1\r\n\n<aside style='background: #f8f8f8;padding: 10px 15px;'><div>All submissions for this problem are available.</div></aside>",
